# Messages shared by the whole tool: report headers, host context table,
# summary, action plan, terminal messages, notes for an AI assistant.
#
# Format: key=text, one message per line. The key stops at the first '='.
# Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored. {name} is replaced by a
# value given by the code; keep the same {names} in every language.
# This file is read as text, never executed. English is the reference: a key
# missing from another language falls back to the text below.
# Not translated on purpose: finding IDs, severity words (CRITICAL, WARNING,
# INFO, OK), commands, --help, error messages and the log line.

